                "text": "It\u2019s DAY 29 of the REPUBLICAN RETREAT.\n\nAmerica is in the middle of a health care crisis, and Republicans have been on vacation for FIVE WEEKS instead of working with Democrats to solve it. Thousands can expect to pay doubled or TRIPLED insurance premiums as a result. https://t.co/bmad1ass8j",
